        "english_translation": "This morning I was late for the office. According to the news, because there was a big cow in front of the train, the train stopped for two hours. When I entered the office at half past nine, the department head was standing in front of his desk. I said, \"I'm sorry I'm late. The train stopped because of a cow.\" The department head laughed. Saying, \"I know. I was on the same train,\" he showed me a photo. In the photo, the cow is looking at the train window. The department head said, \"It was a very quiet cow, wasn't it? It looked at that window for two hours.\" Before starting work, everyone looked at the photo of that cow many times.",
