        "english_translation": "At twelve at night, my husband came home. \"I'm late. The thing is, I had overtime.\" Drinking tea in the kitchen, I asked, \"Really?\" Taking off his shoes, my husband put his bag on the desk. \"The inside of the office was dark, you see. All the doors were closed, you see. Neither the president nor the department head, nobody was there, you see.\" After that, the TV was turned on. The person on the news said, \"Because of the typhoon today, many people took the day off work.\" My husband thought for a little while. He said, \"So the thing is, I did overtime in front of the door.\" My husband slowly drank his tea and got into bed.",
